WEBVTT

01:18.740 --> 01:21.870
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.950 --> 01:24.840
[Episode 20]

01:25.240 --> 01:26.390
I think Qian Fei

01:26.830 --> 01:28.440
staying with the group

01:28.800 --> 01:30.160
isn't really appropriate.

01:30.160 --> 01:30.880
After all,

01:31.470 --> 01:33.270
you don't know her personality.

01:41.470 --> 01:43.789
Whether Qian Fei exists or not is

01:44.000 --> 01:45.390
of no importance to me personally.

01:45.390 --> 01:46.880
But what matters most is

01:46.880 --> 01:49.110
that He Jing Securities can
help Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

01:49.110 --> 01:50.509
successfully go public.

01:50.520 --> 01:52.320
I can tolerate everything else.

01:55.430 --> 01:57.280
Grilled corn is still the best.

01:58.080 --> 01:58.810
Smells good.

02:02.080 --> 02:03.150
Who is it this late?

02:03.430 --> 02:04.280
Open the door.

02:06.590 --> 02:07.320
Who is it?

02:11.150 --> 02:13.080
Is this Mr. Li's house?

02:13.110 --> 02:14.080
Yes.

02:14.390 --> 02:15.430
Come in.

02:15.590 --> 02:17.380
Just put it on the balcony.

02:17.870 --> 02:18.770
What is this?

02:20.360 --> 02:21.820
What did you buy this time?

02:22.390 --> 02:23.120
A treadmill.

02:26.710 --> 02:27.640
The treadmill is set up.

02:27.640 --> 02:28.910
Come out and run!

02:29.110 --> 02:31.450
I'm full today. I'll run tomorrow.

02:32.920 --> 02:33.800
You lazy bones.

03:04.100 --> 03:04.790
Everyone,

03:06.750 --> 03:08.080
I have something to say.

03:12.360 --> 03:14.340
I once confidently believed

03:16.150 --> 03:17.900
that I would never give up
on Xinxin Vision.

03:16.280 --> 03:19.900
[Xinxin Vision Co., Ltd.]

03:21.760 --> 03:23.290
But I overestimated myself

03:23.710 --> 03:25.570
and underestimated this market.

03:28.560 --> 03:29.690
After calming down,

03:33.110 --> 03:35.510
I realized I can't drag you
all down with me.

03:38.590 --> 03:39.950
So, starting today,

03:43.800 --> 03:45.800
we are ceasing company operations.

03:45.980 --> 03:49.390
[Xinxin Vision Co., Ltd.]

03:51.110 --> 03:51.850
Sorry.

04:08.130 --> 04:10.010
[Xinxin Vision Co., Ltd.]

04:25.910 --> 04:26.680
Jingjing

04:29.910 --> 04:30.770
Jingjing

04:31.080 --> 04:32.370
I finally have my own company.

04:32.370 --> 04:33.780
I can realize my dream.

04:33.810 --> 04:35.540
You can realize your dream now.

04:43.470 --> 04:44.200
Are you okay?

04:45.170 --> 04:46.670
No, no. Calm down.

04:47.030 --> 04:48.060
Don't.

04:51.700 --> 04:54.909
[Xinxin Vision Co., Ltd.]

05:01.030 --> 05:07.890
[Xinxin Vision Co., Ltd.]

05:13.290 --> 05:16.230
[Xinxin Vision Co., Ltd.]

05:21.790 --> 05:24.250
Remember to use your hips
to drive your legs.

05:25.080 --> 05:27.790
Don't land on your heels.
Use the balls of your feet.

05:27.790 --> 05:28.590
Like this?

05:28.710 --> 05:29.380
Yes.

05:29.880 --> 05:31.880
Now, let's pick up the pace. Come on.

05:48.920 --> 05:50.960
Just march in place here
and wait for me, okay?

05:50.960 --> 05:51.540
Okay.

05:59.230 --> 06:00.120
Young man.

06:00.560 --> 06:01.360
Well,

06:02.080 --> 06:04.890
this is Ms. Yu, right?

06:05.120 --> 06:05.980
What?

06:06.230 --> 06:07.680
I... I'm not...

06:07.790 --> 06:08.760
How is she?

06:09.520 --> 06:10.770
Is she a good teacher?

06:11.470 --> 06:13.380
You want Ms. Yu as your coach too?

06:13.520 --> 06:14.320
Yes.

06:15.440 --> 06:16.770
Don't think about it.

06:17.200 --> 06:19.480
Ms. Yu is pretty,

06:19.590 --> 06:20.920
and she's a great coach.

06:21.030 --> 06:22.790
No way I'm giving her up to you.

06:23.560 --> 06:25.230
Don't worry, young man.

06:25.350 --> 06:27.650
I'm not asking you to give her up.

06:27.710 --> 06:29.830
I just wanted to ask you

06:29.880 --> 06:31.470
where I can find

06:31.470 --> 06:32.659
a coach who is just as

06:32.760 --> 06:34.080
excellent as her?

06:34.790 --> 06:36.390
My mom found Ms. Yu

06:36.390 --> 06:37.760
through her dance studio.

06:37.760 --> 06:39.080
Why don't you go to the dance studio

06:39.080 --> 06:39.810
and find one?

06:40.200 --> 06:41.790
What's the name of the dance studio?

06:41.790 --> 06:43.150
Zela Dance Studio.

06:43.150 --> 06:43.640
Fatty.

06:46.350 --> 06:47.780
Who are you talking to?

06:47.909 --> 06:48.680
I don't know.

06:50.030 --> 06:51.890
Why aren't you marching in place?

06:52.150 --> 06:52.760
Let's go.

07:05.200 --> 07:06.670
[Deposit]

07:08.870 --> 07:12.920
[The deposit has been transferred.]

07:12.970 --> 07:14.760
[Got it. What do you want?
Be straightforward.]

07:25.510 --> 07:25.940
[Got it. What do you want?
Be straightforward.]

07:25.960 --> 07:27.510
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group
is going public.]

07:27.540 --> 07:30.060
[You sponser know the group's merits
and its dirty little secrets.]

07:34.230 --> 07:35.260
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group is going public]

07:35.290 --> 07:36.320
[You sponser know the group's merits
and its dirty little secrets.]

07:36.340 --> 07:37.720
[I need proof of the loopholes
in housekeeping management.]

07:37.760 --> 07:40.990
[In the hotel business, guest rooms are
what truly touch a consumer's nerve.]

07:41.010 --> 07:41.950
[Wait for my message.]

08:05.410 --> 08:07.020
[Conference Room]

08:07.650 --> 08:08.930
[Conference Room]

08:11.240 --> 08:12.640
[Conference Room]

08:30.470 --> 08:31.190
Qian Fei.

08:31.560 --> 08:32.830
Is this really you?

08:32.960 --> 08:34.440
You've changed a lot.

08:34.590 --> 08:37.190
Qian Fei, what happened to you?

08:38.510 --> 08:40.200
Life's tough,
but you still have to live it.

08:40.200 --> 08:41.510
You can spend the day looking miserable,

08:41.510 --> 08:43.110
or looking fabulous. Right?

08:43.110 --> 08:45.570
You're pretty good at
psyching yourself up.

08:46.680 --> 08:48.250
Well then, gorgeous lady,

08:48.280 --> 08:49.470
could you run down to the lobby for me?

08:49.470 --> 08:51.480
The company sent over a document

08:51.510 --> 08:53.040
that we need for the meeting.

08:53.040 --> 08:53.710
Okay.

08:54.750 --> 08:55.510
Should I go now?

08:55.510 --> 08:56.110
Yes.

08:58.470 --> 08:59.110
Thank you.

08:59.160 --> 09:00.090
You're welcome.

09:07.490 --> 09:10.470
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

09:12.630 --> 09:14.230
Wow, what a great boyfriend!

09:14.230 --> 09:16.350
Sending you so many gifts
this early in the morning.

09:16.350 --> 09:18.350
Does sending gifts automatically
make him my boyfriend?

09:18.350 --> 09:20.000
Which one do you like? Take it.

09:20.000 --> 09:20.830
Really?

09:20.270 --> 09:22.310
[Gentle breeze, romantic flowers.
You're unique, and I adore you.]

09:21.040 --> 09:22.400
I'll take it then.

09:22.400 --> 09:23.600
I want the chocolate.

09:24.200 --> 09:25.080
Here, take it.

09:26.570 --> 09:28.940
You might as well take the boyfriend
along with it.

09:27.310 --> 09:30.090
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

09:29.160 --> 09:30.200
I don't have a boyfriend.

09:30.200 --> 09:31.660
If you don't want him, I do.

09:32.110 --> 09:33.320
When it comes to boyfriend,

09:33.320 --> 09:34.680
you're drooling.

09:33.380 --> 09:35.720
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

09:35.830 --> 09:38.230
Investment banking girls are
always swamped.

09:38.230 --> 09:39.590
Of course I got really excited

09:39.590 --> 09:41.120
hearing about boyfriends.

09:46.110 --> 09:48.220
He's clingy all day long,

09:48.470 --> 09:50.440
and he pulls all these flashy stunts.

09:50.440 --> 09:51.240
So annoying.

09:57.920 --> 10:00.200
Jun usually seems so dull,

10:00.280 --> 10:02.630
but he sure knows how to pull off
that puppy-dog routine.

10:02.630 --> 10:04.580
Why don't you just adopt him?

10:06.630 --> 10:08.230
Did Jun actually manage
to win over Dang Yu?

10:08.230 --> 10:09.340
You scared me.

10:10.750 --> 10:11.580
Pretty much.

10:11.760 --> 10:12.590
Let me listen.

10:14.710 --> 10:16.870
Forget it. If I adopt him,

10:16.870 --> 10:18.960
his mother will come to me.

10:19.760 --> 10:20.730
Sure.

10:20.960 --> 10:23.400
But didn't Jun move into the dorms?

10:23.960 --> 10:26.160
His mom can't be watching him every day.

10:26.510 --> 10:27.160
True.

10:28.040 --> 10:29.570
This is a good opportunity.

10:30.830 --> 10:31.560
You know?

10:31.630 --> 10:34.400
Jun is reliable and simple.

10:34.510 --> 10:35.230
Very stable.

10:35.230 --> 10:36.080
Very stable.

10:36.080 --> 10:36.710
Very persistent.

10:36.710 --> 10:37.590
Very persistent.

10:37.590 --> 10:39.230
You must seize the chance.

10:42.040 --> 10:42.630
OK.

10:43.510 --> 10:44.240
Sounds good.

10:45.200 --> 10:46.110
Let's go.

10:54.350 --> 10:54.960
By the way,

10:55.200 --> 10:57.260
I haven't had time to thank you today.

10:57.830 --> 10:58.470
Thank me?

10:59.560 --> 11:01.420
You'll have to elaborate on that.

11:02.320 --> 11:03.380
Like you said,

11:03.400 --> 11:05.160
a new look brings new luck.

11:05.560 --> 11:07.110
The legal notice for me and Dang Yu

11:07.110 --> 11:08.390
has been withdrawn.

11:09.870 --> 11:11.230
It's nothing.

11:11.510 --> 11:13.770
You wanted to thank me in person for this?

11:14.990 --> 11:16.870
So, how are you going to thank me?

11:19.070 --> 11:20.830
You're expecting a feast, huh?

11:21.080 --> 11:22.280
You said it.

11:22.470 --> 11:23.230
I like that.

11:24.280 --> 11:24.920
Go ahead.

11:25.550 --> 11:27.480
Steamed lamb, steamed bear paw...

11:39.980 --> 11:41.350
Excuse me. Sorry to interrupt.

11:41.350 --> 11:42.680
I wanted to ask

11:42.750 --> 11:44.670
which floor is

11:44.800 --> 11:46.240
the Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's café on?

11:46.240 --> 11:47.080
The café?

11:47.110 --> 11:48.810
It's in the lobby downstairs.

11:49.050 --> 11:50.530
But this elevator goes up.

11:50.560 --> 11:51.380
It's not up there.

11:51.380 --> 11:53.440
There are only bars and restaurants.

11:53.800 --> 11:54.800
Okay, thank you.

11:54.870 --> 11:55.800
You're welcome.

12:05.920 --> 12:06.710
Okay, I'm sorry.

12:06.710 --> 12:09.520
I admit I asked that on purpose just now.

12:09.710 --> 12:11.710
Because I simply couldn't control

12:11.710 --> 12:12.830
the impulse inside me

12:12.830 --> 12:14.110
to get to know

12:14.200 --> 12:16.350
the beautiful girl standing before me.

12:16.350 --> 12:18.400
So I came up with that really lame excuse.

12:18.400 --> 12:19.400
Would you mind?

12:21.800 --> 12:24.060
My name is Qiu Shi.
Could I get to know you?

12:25.320 --> 12:25.880
No.

12:29.310 --> 12:32.250
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

12:29.400 --> 12:30.230
What are you doing?

12:30.230 --> 12:30.800
Ruining someone's romantic prospects

12:30.800 --> 12:32.200
is a sin, you know that?

12:32.360 --> 12:36.060
[He Jing Securities Co., Ltd.]

12:39.480 --> 12:41.600
[Live Streaming]

12:41.630 --> 12:42.320
[Oh. Poor woman.]

12:42.340 --> 12:43.060
[Damn, Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's heiress
is clearly no good.]

12:43.080 --> 12:44.740
[The key is getting proof.
He'll never admit it.]

12:44.870 --> 12:46.010
Again?

12:58.710 --> 13:01.230
You just informed the Legal Department
to withdraw the notice,

13:01.230 --> 13:03.560
and right after that, we were humiliated.

13:05.830 --> 13:06.980
I really didn't expect

13:06.980 --> 13:10.180
that backing down repeatedly
would lead to this outcome.

13:11.080 --> 13:12.920
Now I'm the undisputed villain.

13:14.920 --> 13:16.080
It's precisely because we gave in

13:16.080 --> 13:17.610
that we ended up here today.

13:19.850 --> 13:21.210
Actually, I'm fine.

13:21.730 --> 13:24.130
I'm just worried
about the pressure on you.

13:26.190 --> 13:27.900
I feel that simply kicking her
out of the company

13:27.900 --> 13:30.100
goes against my principles and morals.

13:30.960 --> 13:32.110
Both of our principles

13:32.110 --> 13:34.110
are just too considerate of others.

13:36.320 --> 13:37.590
I think this time,

13:37.710 --> 13:39.040
we can't give in anymore.

13:39.040 --> 13:40.920
One wrong step leads to another.

13:41.160 --> 13:42.620
If we keep indulging this,

13:42.710 --> 13:44.970
who knows what new trouble it will cause.

13:49.130 --> 13:50.010
Show her.

13:50.960 --> 13:51.740
Qian Fei.

13:59.870 --> 14:02.000
What... What is this? Who filmed this?

14:07.230 --> 14:08.450
Everyone, get out.

14:08.510 --> 14:10.280
I need to talk to Qian Fei alone.

14:14.830 --> 14:16.870
Director Fang. Director Li.

14:17.320 --> 14:18.230
I'm sorry.

14:17.400 --> 14:19.540
[Phase III Report on the Due Diligence
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

14:18.320 --> 14:20.450
Could you please step out for a moment?

14:41.860 --> 14:43.960
Qian Fei,
you really know how to play dirty.

14:43.960 --> 14:45.680
Getting someone to film that video,

14:45.680 --> 14:47.200
using public opinion to help you

14:47.200 --> 14:48.200
and embarrass me.

14:50.510 --> 14:51.620
You're smart,

14:51.870 --> 14:53.400
but you underestimated me.

14:53.470 --> 14:55.330
Do you think I'll be afraid of you?

14:55.830 --> 14:58.040
I just saw this video.

14:58.110 --> 14:59.320
I'm also a victim.

14:59.350 --> 15:01.550
I don't know where this video came from.

15:02.350 --> 15:04.210
You're quite the actor, Qian Fei.

15:05.040 --> 15:07.430
I apologized to you sincerely.

15:07.510 --> 15:09.230
This video has nothing to do with me.

15:09.230 --> 15:11.350
You can't talk your way out of this.

15:12.160 --> 15:14.110
But based on the beneficiary inference,

15:14.110 --> 15:16.040
I can only conclude that you did it.

15:16.680 --> 15:17.080
No.

15:17.110 --> 15:19.320
Since neither you nor I know

15:19.320 --> 15:20.320
what really happened,

15:20.320 --> 15:21.680
then a third party must be

15:21.680 --> 15:22.860
setting this up.

15:22.920 --> 15:25.100
Even if you didn't plan this,

15:25.470 --> 15:27.900
it actually interfered with me.

15:28.080 --> 15:29.990
That can't be an excuse for you.

15:30.920 --> 15:32.180
I've thought about it.

15:32.180 --> 15:34.340
[Phase III Report on the Due Diligence
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

15:32.280 --> 15:33.820
The easiest way:

15:34.440 --> 15:35.040
You

15:35.750 --> 15:38.880
leave the due diligence team
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group.

15:41.330 --> 15:44.430
[Phase III Report on the Due Diligence
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

15:48.280 --> 15:49.200
Director Fang,

15:49.810 --> 15:51.260
please come here.

15:58.510 --> 16:00.780
My classmates asked me this morning

16:00.870 --> 16:03.290
if I'm working in the Shan Li Fang,

16:03.350 --> 16:04.830
and if I knew any inside scoop.

16:04.830 --> 16:05.770
How would I know?

16:06.280 --> 16:07.610
Why has there been

16:08.160 --> 16:09.710
so much gossip about Shan Li Fang lately?

16:09.710 --> 16:10.680
Tell me about it.

16:10.800 --> 16:11.990
Even my mother-in-law heard about it.

16:11.990 --> 16:14.360
This is practically public knowledge.

16:15.320 --> 16:16.810
I've spoken with Qian Fei.

16:16.920 --> 16:18.470
Given the series of pulic controversies

16:18.470 --> 16:19.900
that have arisen

16:19.920 --> 16:21.930
since she started working here recently,

16:21.930 --> 16:24.110
which have significantly impacted me,

16:24.110 --> 16:26.510
I am requesting her transfer off

16:26.510 --> 16:29.310
the due diligence team
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group.

16:34.800 --> 16:36.060
What's your attitude?

16:38.900 --> 16:39.590
I...

16:43.680 --> 16:44.880
Since we all agree,

16:45.290 --> 16:46.400
then there's nothing else to discuss.

16:46.400 --> 16:48.590
Director Fang, please report this

16:48.590 --> 16:50.440
to He Jing Securities headquarters.

16:50.440 --> 16:51.230
Ms. Liao.

16:53.320 --> 16:54.040
Excuse me,

16:54.070 --> 16:55.440
but may I remind you,

16:55.440 --> 16:56.360
He Jing's purpose here

16:56.360 --> 16:58.510
at Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

16:58.680 --> 17:00.750
is to help Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

17:00.750 --> 17:02.030
complete its IPO.

17:02.710 --> 17:05.060
As for maintaining your personal image,

17:05.349 --> 17:07.000
or quelling public opinion,

17:07.030 --> 17:08.880
that should be handled
by Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's

17:08.880 --> 17:10.119
Public Relations Department,

17:10.119 --> 17:12.230
not our responsibility, right?

17:14.530 --> 17:16.810
So, whether an employee of He Jing

17:16.990 --> 17:19.530
got wrapped up
in this public scandal or not,

17:19.960 --> 17:21.500
their retention or dismissal

17:21.500 --> 17:23.810
should be decided by us at He Jing, right?

17:24.220 --> 17:25.460
What do you mean?

17:27.030 --> 17:28.230
As her supervisor,

17:29.120 --> 17:29.990
I don't agree.

17:34.310 --> 17:36.510
I don't need your permission either.

17:36.960 --> 17:38.220
I'm informing you now.

17:38.230 --> 17:39.550
I am demanding her removal

17:39.550 --> 17:41.600
from the due diligence team
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group.

17:41.600 --> 17:43.330
I refuse to have anyone

17:43.360 --> 17:45.310
I don't want to see on the vendor's team.

17:45.310 --> 17:46.230
Director Fang,

17:46.440 --> 17:48.470
please coordinate this as soon as possible

17:48.470 --> 17:50.530
to stop Qian Fei from working here.

17:50.680 --> 17:51.880
You just said

17:51.880 --> 17:53.790
that we have a client-vendor relationship.

17:53.790 --> 17:55.230
The partnership
between Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

17:55.230 --> 17:57.030
and He Jing

17:57.160 --> 17:59.290
is based on professional capability,

17:59.310 --> 18:01.200
not personal feelings

18:01.270 --> 18:02.800
or private grudges.

18:02.960 --> 18:05.690
I believe Ms. Liao wouldn't be
so narrow-minded.

18:06.750 --> 18:07.640
Therefore,

18:08.270 --> 18:10.550
the sole criteria for deciding

18:10.640 --> 18:12.450
the fate of He Jing employees

18:12.600 --> 18:14.400
should be their work capability.

18:14.400 --> 18:15.410
Whether it

18:16.030 --> 18:17.430
meets my standards.

18:17.880 --> 18:18.960
Based on this,

18:19.230 --> 18:21.370
with Qian Fei's current performance,

18:21.880 --> 18:24.070
I'm afraid I can't accept your suggestion.

18:24.070 --> 18:25.050
Unless,

18:26.440 --> 18:28.680
you wish to end the cooperation

18:28.680 --> 18:29.920
between Shan Li Fang Hotel Group
and He Jing,

18:29.920 --> 18:32.650
or request the headquarters
to transfer me away.

18:39.290 --> 18:40.930
I have doubts

18:40.960 --> 18:42.560
about Qian Fei's character.

18:43.590 --> 18:44.960
I have reason to doubt

18:45.040 --> 18:47.770
that an employee like her
can adequately perform

18:47.790 --> 18:50.590
the due diligence work
at Shan Li Fang Hotel Group.

18:51.390 --> 18:53.790
Director Fang values efficiency the most.

18:54.050 --> 18:56.200
An employee who causes so many issues

18:56.230 --> 18:57.890
must be a headache for you too.

18:57.960 --> 18:59.310
I will assess her performance

18:59.310 --> 19:00.600
in my own way.

19:00.750 --> 19:02.030
You don't have to question

19:02.030 --> 19:03.640
my ability to evaluate my staff,

19:03.640 --> 19:05.600
or is Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

19:05.600 --> 19:07.470
now starting to doubt

19:07.470 --> 19:09.670
He Jing's professional capabilities?

19:13.490 --> 19:14.100
I dare not.

19:14.640 --> 19:18.120
He Jing Securities is a benchmark
in the investment banking industry.

19:18.120 --> 19:21.350
Naturally, we always let our results
speak for themselves.

19:21.350 --> 19:23.510
So, regarding the employment status
of He Jing's employees,

19:23.510 --> 19:24.790
we ask for your trust

19:24.810 --> 19:26.030
and leave the arrangements to us.

19:26.030 --> 19:26.710
Thank you.

19:31.710 --> 19:32.300
Okay.

19:33.510 --> 19:34.450
Well then,

19:35.640 --> 19:36.660
I'll wait and see.

19:47.580 --> 19:48.610
Director Fang.

19:49.370 --> 19:51.090
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

19:51.650 --> 19:53.130
You trusted me so much,

19:53.160 --> 19:54.970
but ever since I joined Shan Li Fang,

19:54.970 --> 19:56.500
I've been causing trouble.

19:57.330 --> 19:59.360
And you just defended me so strongly.

19:59.360 --> 20:00.470
I'm defending you?

20:01.360 --> 20:02.730
I'm defending He Jing.

20:03.210 --> 20:05.200
If we let the client
push us around like this,

20:05.200 --> 20:06.440
how are we supposed to work?

20:06.440 --> 20:08.400
How can we survive in this
industry?

20:08.400 --> 20:09.660
Don't you understand?

20:10.200 --> 20:11.470
Let me tell you one more thing.

20:11.470 --> 20:13.440
You're a liability on this project team.

20:13.440 --> 20:14.680
Understand?

20:16.030 --> 20:18.040
Yes, I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

20:18.070 --> 20:19.200
You haven't improved at all.

20:19.200 --> 20:20.070
You always apologise.

20:20.070 --> 20:21.870
Does saying sorry fix anything?

20:23.070 --> 20:24.440
Show me your value.

20:25.390 --> 20:27.700
Here, value is everything.

20:28.120 --> 20:28.680
Okay?

20:33.860 --> 20:38.530
[Conference Room]

21:02.190 --> 21:04.000
Director Fang helped me so much.

21:04.030 --> 21:05.760
Could there be another motive?

21:07.810 --> 21:09.420
Alright, forget about it.

21:10.530 --> 21:12.460
Let's celebrate after work today.

21:13.710 --> 21:14.720
Celebrate what?

21:15.470 --> 21:17.840
Celebrate that you
survived another day

21:17.840 --> 21:19.770
on the project team of Shan Li Fang.

21:22.270 --> 21:23.990
I was really shocked today.

21:24.270 --> 21:26.420
The way Director Fang stood up
to Liao Shiyu,

21:26.420 --> 21:29.330
the presence, the poise, the eloquence...

21:29.920 --> 21:31.720
She was absolutely commanding.

21:32.510 --> 21:33.910
That's why you're naive.

21:35.130 --> 21:36.600
Any normal person would see that

21:36.600 --> 21:37.790
it was simply when you beat a dog,

21:37.790 --> 21:39.990
you have to consider its owner, right?

21:42.750 --> 21:44.240
But I did change your fate.

21:44.270 --> 21:45.330
Didn't you notice?

21:46.250 --> 21:48.380
You keep getting ridiculously lucky.

21:48.760 --> 21:50.440
Now that you mention it,
it does seem true.

21:50.440 --> 21:52.170
You should take all the credit.

21:52.390 --> 21:53.710
Then allow me

21:53.960 --> 21:55.990
to thank you for changing my image

21:56.120 --> 21:57.580
and rewriting my destiny.

21:57.960 --> 21:59.440
To express my gratitude,

21:59.470 --> 22:02.310
I'm going to treat you
to a nice dinner tonight.

22:02.600 --> 22:04.000
Tell me, what do you want to eat?

22:04.000 --> 22:05.650
I won't back down today.

22:05.680 --> 22:07.230
OK. You said it.

22:09.210 --> 22:11.100
Seeing how broke you are,

22:11.650 --> 22:12.850
I won't bleed you dry.

22:15.870 --> 22:16.730
How about this?

22:17.150 --> 22:19.950
I'll lower my expectations
by ten thousand times.

22:20.990 --> 22:22.250
Unlimited sea urchin.

22:29.840 --> 22:30.730
Got it.

22:38.710 --> 22:40.160
You never listen to me anyway,

22:40.160 --> 22:41.570
so why bother asking?

22:41.960 --> 22:43.680
Where's the sea urchin here?

22:43.710 --> 22:44.470
Excuse me.

22:45.090 --> 22:46.330
Try the sea urchins

22:46.360 --> 22:47.550
in your memory.

22:47.680 --> 22:48.320
Fine.

22:49.710 --> 22:50.960
Fine, fine, fine.

22:52.440 --> 22:53.680
Help me grill it.

22:53.680 --> 22:55.160
Are you just waiting to eat?

22:55.160 --> 22:57.200
I already lowered my standards for you.

22:57.200 --> 22:58.270
Now you want me

22:58.270 --> 22:59.440
to do the grilling myself?

22:59.440 --> 23:01.200
Besides, you're the one treating.

23:01.200 --> 23:03.270
Have a little host spirit, will you?

23:03.400 --> 23:05.350
Don't sweat the small stuff.

23:06.070 --> 23:07.270
I'm totally done

23:07.310 --> 23:08.960
with your sharp tongue.

23:11.230 --> 23:12.310
Aren't you curious

23:12.310 --> 23:14.640
who actually uploaded that garage video?

23:17.370 --> 23:19.440
There's always no shortage of busybodies.

23:19.440 --> 23:20.570
Why worry about it?

23:20.750 --> 23:22.550
Just focus on doing your own thing.

23:22.550 --> 23:23.950
That's all that matters.

23:24.790 --> 23:27.600
And what I'm most curious about right now

23:27.710 --> 23:28.420
What?

23:29.790 --> 23:30.840
is who's going to

23:31.710 --> 23:33.950
grab the first piece of grilled meat.

23:34.200 --> 23:35.410
That must be me.

23:44.750 --> 23:46.610
This is so good! Who grilled this?

23:48.310 --> 23:49.360
It smells so good.

23:49.430 --> 23:50.750
The landlady did.

24:07.710 --> 24:08.790
Did you take a photo?

24:08.790 --> 24:09.310
Yes, I did.

24:09.310 --> 24:10.670
Let me have a look.

24:10.990 --> 24:11.470
Okay.

24:14.740 --> 24:17.610
Young girls these days are so childish.

24:19.730 --> 24:20.920
No one is as childish as you.

24:20.920 --> 24:22.310
What's wrong with being a fan?

24:22.310 --> 24:23.550
It's normal.

24:23.750 --> 24:25.200
And I've been fangirling lately.

24:25.200 --> 24:26.040
You?

24:26.440 --> 24:27.400
You're a fan?

24:27.640 --> 24:28.940
-Of who?
-I've been following

24:28.940 --> 24:30.010
a crosstalk actor.

24:30.790 --> 24:31.720
What's his name?

24:31.960 --> 24:33.680
Osamu. You've probably never heard of him.

24:33.680 --> 24:34.840
He's really popular now.

24:34.840 --> 24:35.900
Never heard of him.

24:36.070 --> 24:37.180
Let me look him up.

24:37.840 --> 24:39.180
Okay, let me see.

24:43.230 --> 24:43.960
See?

24:43.990 --> 24:46.900
A top-tier human blending wisdom

24:44.100 --> 24:46.740
[Album]

24:46.920 --> 24:48.110
and striking looks.

24:48.770 --> 24:49.580
This guy?

24:50.020 --> 24:51.400
Blending wisdom and striking looks?

24:51.400 --> 24:52.510
This's just a goofy look.

24:52.510 --> 24:53.440
You're into this type?

24:53.440 --> 24:54.830
Shut up, Li Yifei.

24:54.850 --> 24:56.160
If you say one more word,

24:56.160 --> 24:57.760
I'm cutting you off, I swear.

24:59.160 --> 24:59.960
Alright.

25:00.030 --> 25:00.960
I'm done.

25:01.070 --> 25:02.580
Then please tell me,

25:02.920 --> 25:04.380
why do you like him so much?

25:04.400 --> 25:05.140
Because

25:05.230 --> 25:07.360
I think he's an inspirational person.

25:07.470 --> 25:08.960
Many years ago,

25:09.310 --> 25:11.170
he was in a terrible car accident.

25:11.230 --> 25:13.840
He had dozens of steel pins
implanted in his body

25:13.840 --> 25:15.080
and almost died.

25:15.880 --> 25:16.760
But later,

25:16.790 --> 25:19.120
he turned everything that happened to him

25:19.270 --> 25:21.490
into comedy bits to make people laugh.

25:23.270 --> 25:24.670
Every time I see him,

25:25.200 --> 25:26.490
it reminds me

25:28.550 --> 25:30.150
that as long as you persevere

25:30.750 --> 25:33.560
whether in life or in chasing your dreams,

25:34.270 --> 25:35.400
God

25:36.550 --> 25:38.070
will give you a chance.

25:50.440 --> 25:51.440
What's wrong?

25:52.160 --> 25:53.620
Did you make yourself sad?

25:54.790 --> 25:57.800
He has a solo show this weekend.

25:58.550 --> 26:01.350
I'd really like to go,
but the tickets are sold out.

26:03.270 --> 26:04.900
I thought something happened.

26:04.900 --> 26:06.130
It's just a ticket.

26:06.160 --> 26:07.350
I will get it for you.

26:07.770 --> 26:09.570
With what, your big mouth?

26:09.640 --> 26:10.840
Underestimating me?

26:11.160 --> 26:11.880
Listen,

26:11.880 --> 26:13.990
I can actually get it with this big mouth.

26:13.990 --> 26:15.200
You're bragging.

26:15.710 --> 26:16.910
You don't believe me?

26:17.390 --> 26:18.790
Let me make it clear today.

26:18.790 --> 26:20.400
Not only can I get you that ticket,

26:20.400 --> 26:21.680
I can get you front-row seats,

26:21.680 --> 26:23.080
the most expensive ones.

26:24.030 --> 26:25.910
Let me make it clear too.

26:26.060 --> 26:28.120
If you can get me this ticket,

26:28.230 --> 26:29.130
I'll take your last name.

26:29.130 --> 26:31.240
Well done. Comrade Li Fei.

26:31.680 --> 26:33.680
I'll make sure your wish comes true.

26:43.040 --> 26:43.180
is Point Three.

26:43.040 --> 26:43.340
[Five-star hotel: Bath towel used
on toilet, then on water cup.]

26:43.440 --> 26:48.880
[Point Three]

26:44.080 --> 26:45.810
Initially,

26:45.880 --> 26:47.430
he had less than 50,000 followers.

26:47.430 --> 26:49.050
But after this post,

26:49.080 --> 26:51.240
his followers increased to 300,000.

26:51.280 --> 26:53.640
Reposts have already surpassed 900,000,

26:53.710 --> 26:56.020
views are nearing 50 million,

26:56.190 --> 26:58.280
and these numbers keep multiplying.

26:58.390 --> 26:59.840
Is Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

26:59.840 --> 27:01.400
mentioned prominently

27:01.430 --> 27:02.890
in the reports and videos?

27:04.120 --> 27:06.290
This matter involves

27:04.510 --> 27:05.980
[Five-star hotel: Bath towel used
on toilet, then on water cup.]

27:06.320 --> 27:08.360
nine well-known hotel groups,
domestic and international.

27:08.360 --> 27:09.840
Our Shan Li Fang Hotel

27:09.500 --> 27:11.020
[Five-star hotel: Bath towel used
on toilet, then on water cup.]

27:09.910 --> 27:11.730
is the fifth one mentioned.

27:11.040 --> 27:11.630
[Shan Li Fang Hotel,
A Domestic Hotel Chain]

27:11.910 --> 27:13.090
Of the other eight,

27:13.190 --> 27:15.280
four are international hotel chains,

27:15.280 --> 27:16.490
including two

27:16.520 --> 27:19.120
that rank among the top ten globally
by market value.

27:19.120 --> 27:21.360
The other five are domestic chains.

27:21.540 --> 27:23.450
The stock prices of listed hotels

27:23.640 --> 27:25.750
are experiencing wild fluctuations.

27:25.750 --> 27:27.880
Have any of the implicated hotels
made public statements?

27:27.880 --> 27:28.800
Not yet.

27:28.910 --> 27:30.150
Because this kind of thing

27:30.150 --> 27:31.390
has happened before.

27:31.520 --> 27:32.840
Based on previous experience,

27:32.840 --> 27:35.050
they usually deny it,

27:35.120 --> 27:36.910
and shut down public comment channels.

27:36.910 --> 27:38.920
The public will forget it soon.

27:39.040 --> 27:40.910
After all, internet trends pile up

27:40.910 --> 27:42.520
at an incredibly fast pace.

27:42.560 --> 27:43.420
OK.

27:43.600 --> 27:45.840
This time,
let's not be the first to respond.

27:45.840 --> 27:48.100
Just follow the lead of the other hotels.

27:48.950 --> 27:50.600
I've followed those similar incidents

27:50.600 --> 27:51.730
that you mentioned.

27:51.750 --> 27:52.670
But I always feel

27:52.670 --> 27:53.710
that our situation

27:53.710 --> 27:54.670
isn't on the same level

27:54.670 --> 27:55.830
as those other ones.

27:55.950 --> 27:57.800
Our response seems too standard.

27:57.800 --> 27:58.320
I think...

27:58.320 --> 27:59.420
Time is precious.

27:59.880 --> 28:01.430
Let's not discuss this further here.

28:01.430 --> 28:02.010
Mr. Wu,

28:02.190 --> 28:04.560
tell the Public Relations Department
to prepare in advance.

28:04.560 --> 28:05.150
OK.

28:11.280 --> 28:13.670
As you can see,

28:13.670 --> 28:16.200
-Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's handling
-You should be grateful to Dian San San.

28:16.200 --> 28:18.070
-of this trust crisis
-She's probably overwhelmed right now,

28:18.070 --> 28:19.830
-has had little impact on us.
-and doesn't have time to bother you.

28:19.830 --> 28:23.040
So, we can continue with our work.

28:23.630 --> 28:25.820
Do you have any other opinions?

28:26.640 --> 28:27.500
Director Fang,

28:28.320 --> 28:30.490
I think this collective trust crisis

28:30.520 --> 28:32.640
will impact Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's

28:32.640 --> 28:35.040
pre-IPO image.

28:35.150 --> 28:36.750
I suggest advising the client

28:36.750 --> 28:37.840
to handle this more appropriately,

28:37.840 --> 28:39.320
The approach suggested in the PR plan,

28:39.320 --> 28:40.560
seems inadequate.

28:40.670 --> 28:41.710
At a time like this,

28:41.710 --> 28:42.910
recklessly adopting a conservative,

28:42.910 --> 28:44.360
copycat approach

28:44.360 --> 28:45.450
will leave Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

28:45.450 --> 28:46.980
in a very passive position.

28:47.600 --> 28:49.200
And I think this incident

28:49.230 --> 28:51.130
doesn't just concern
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

28:51.130 --> 28:53.120
and the other eight companies involved.

28:53.120 --> 28:56.060
It's a crisis of trust
for the entire industry.

28:56.090 --> 28:57.230
So I suggest

28:57.280 --> 28:59.290
Shan Li Fang's final response

28:59.320 --> 29:00.990
should not only consider itself

29:00.990 --> 29:04.120
but also the healthy development
of the whole industry.

29:07.190 --> 29:09.010
That's quite a broad vision.

29:10.120 --> 29:11.230
I'd like to hear

29:11.230 --> 29:13.080
how you manage the whole industry.

29:13.080 --> 29:15.620
If we can't manage it,
we can set an example.

29:15.650 --> 29:16.810
Since Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

29:16.810 --> 29:18.710
is currently preparing for its IPO,

29:18.710 --> 29:21.020
its market share and domestic influence

29:21.050 --> 29:23.280
are actually on par
with other hotel brands.

29:23.280 --> 29:24.320
So if Shan Li Fang

29:24.320 --> 29:26.190
leads the way now,

29:26.190 --> 29:27.470
I believe other hotels

29:27.470 --> 29:28.800
will follow suit.

29:29.670 --> 29:31.200
According to your opinion,

29:31.200 --> 29:32.390
how should Shan Li Fang Group

29:32.390 --> 29:34.750
set this example?

29:35.470 --> 29:38.270
-First, the most important thing is...
-Qian Fei.

29:38.670 --> 29:40.450
The way the hotel industry handles things

29:40.450 --> 29:42.720
may be different from other industries.

29:42.740 --> 29:44.630
After all, we are the sponsor.

29:44.950 --> 29:46.360
In terms of hotel operations
and management,

29:46.360 --> 29:47.680
we're certainly not as good as them.

29:47.680 --> 29:49.430
Let's just focus on the IPO preparations.

29:49.430 --> 29:51.360
They can handle their own crisis PR.

29:51.360 --> 29:52.330
But...

29:53.950 --> 29:55.010
That's all for now.

29:55.430 --> 29:57.340
Based on the current situation,

29:58.470 --> 30:01.130
this has little impact
on our sponsorship work.

30:01.320 --> 30:01.880
Besides,

30:01.880 --> 30:02.990
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

30:02.990 --> 30:05.990
has its own PR team to deal with it.

30:06.710 --> 30:08.850
We don't need to worry too much.

30:09.800 --> 30:11.230
Right, it's almost the end of the year.

30:11.230 --> 30:13.470
Everyone, focus on your own work.

30:14.080 --> 30:15.280
That's all for today.

30:32.640 --> 30:34.500
Why did you interrupt me just now?

30:38.190 --> 30:40.390
Because your suggestion was very good.

30:40.850 --> 30:43.510
If it was so good,
why didn't you let me continue?

30:43.550 --> 30:45.070
I finally got a chance

30:45.090 --> 30:46.870
to show my value.

30:46.900 --> 30:48.560
And Director Fang has always
stood up for me.

30:48.560 --> 30:50.490
You made me miss this opportunity.

30:51.690 --> 30:54.560
I just can't let you
miss this opportunity for nothing.

30:54.560 --> 30:56.710
You have to say it at the perfect moment,

30:56.710 --> 30:58.570
that's what makes it meaningful.

30:58.710 --> 31:00.370
Now is obviously not the time.

31:01.280 --> 31:02.340
Do you understand?

31:04.560 --> 31:05.300
Really?

31:09.390 --> 31:10.560
Such a cunning strategist.

31:10.560 --> 31:11.430
Silly girl.

31:13.600 --> 31:15.330
You'd better not try to fool me.

31:22.410 --> 31:28.390
[Zela Dance Studio]

31:24.490 --> 31:25.530
Hello, ma'am.

31:25.560 --> 31:27.320
Are you here to inquire
about dance classes

31:27.320 --> 31:28.840
for your grandchildren?

31:29.560 --> 31:31.070
My son is not married yet.

31:31.090 --> 31:33.040
I don't have any grandchildren.

31:33.130 --> 31:34.850
So you want to learn yourself?

31:34.880 --> 31:36.840
We specialize in hip-hop dance.

31:36.880 --> 31:38.670
Would you be interested?

31:39.080 --> 31:40.150
Hip... what?

31:42.150 --> 31:43.990
You mean

31:43.990 --> 31:45.850
the kind of dance in this picture?

31:46.710 --> 31:48.520
Yes, you can look into it.

31:56.580 --> 31:57.760
[Dang Yu]

31:59.470 --> 32:00.360
Well...

32:00.800 --> 32:03.320
Do any older people come to learn this?

32:03.430 --> 32:04.280
Of course.

32:06.840 --> 32:07.690
Auntie.

32:08.460 --> 32:10.820
Ms. Yu, you know each other?

32:14.670 --> 32:16.980
You're not here to learn to dance,
are you?

32:16.980 --> 32:19.340
If I'm not here to learn,
why would I come?

32:21.330 --> 32:23.680
I know you're here for me.

32:26.150 --> 32:28.780
Come here. I have something to tell you.

32:37.290 --> 32:39.910
[Zela Dance Studio]

32:40.560 --> 32:41.640
Auntie, please go ahead.

32:41.640 --> 32:42.900
I have other work to do.

32:43.250 --> 32:50.080
[Zela Dance Studio]

32:45.430 --> 32:47.930
To be honest, we older folks

32:48.520 --> 32:50.240
don't really want to get involved

32:50.240 --> 32:51.970
in you young people's affairs.

32:53.230 --> 32:54.270
But

32:55.670 --> 32:57.990
your current working condition—

32:58.320 --> 33:00.230
floating around doing odd jobs,

33:00.840 --> 33:02.410
I can't stand it.

33:02.600 --> 33:05.640
Right? look at you and our Jun:

33:05.660 --> 33:08.390
your jobs, your schedules,

33:08.430 --> 33:10.320
your backgrounds,

33:10.320 --> 33:11.960
nothing matches.

33:12.280 --> 33:13.120
To put it simply,

33:13.120 --> 33:14.840
even the way we eat

33:14.900 --> 33:17.610
-is very different from Shanghainese...
-Auntie.

33:17.610 --> 33:19.200
You're saying that Jun and I

33:19.230 --> 33:20.860
are not suitable, right?

33:21.670 --> 33:23.710
Do you think you're suitable?

33:24.080 --> 33:24.910
I think

33:25.040 --> 33:26.150
whether we're suitable or not

33:26.150 --> 33:28.610
is something you should discuss
with your precious son,

33:28.610 --> 33:29.950
After all, you are his mother,

33:29.950 --> 33:31.040
not mine.

33:34.070 --> 33:35.270
Auntie, I'm leaving.

33:35.670 --> 33:36.150
Bye.

33:36.750 --> 33:38.470
What do you mean?

33:38.560 --> 33:39.430
The way you talk...

33:39.430 --> 33:40.360
Yu, you're off work.

33:39.500 --> 33:40.610
[Zela Dance Studio]

33:40.390 --> 33:41.390
Hello, Aunt Wang.

33:42.040 --> 33:44.180
Mrs. Jun, why are you here?

33:44.880 --> 33:46.120
Leader.

33:46.150 --> 33:48.280
Why are you here?

33:48.390 --> 33:51.310
This dance studio is run by my daughter.

33:51.350 --> 33:53.580
Come on, come on, let's go sit inside!

33:54.120 --> 33:55.440
Let's go to the office.

33:55.440 --> 33:57.340
It's run by your daughter?

33:58.090 --> 33:59.240
You want me to start

33:59.270 --> 34:00.710
a senior dance class here?

34:00.710 --> 34:02.580
Yes, what do you think?

34:03.210 --> 34:04.920
Sounds great.

34:06.480 --> 34:08.590
First of all, your daughter is here,

34:08.620 --> 34:09.929
and it's her studio,

34:10.040 --> 34:12.020
of course I'll help out.

34:13.909 --> 34:16.239
And, you choosing me

34:16.270 --> 34:19.310
means you approve of my abilities,

34:19.310 --> 34:19.960
right?

34:19.960 --> 34:21.429
Of course.

34:23.750 --> 34:24.820
I

34:25.960 --> 34:27.219
only have one request.

34:28.150 --> 34:31.460
Arrange my classes

34:31.560 --> 34:33.810
on the same days as Dang Yu's,

34:34.440 --> 34:35.870
so that I can meet her.

34:35.889 --> 34:38.150
That way, I can get to know her better.

34:39.230 --> 34:42.330
Mrs. Jun, you're so smart.

34:42.400 --> 34:43.920
I know what you mean.

34:44.340 --> 34:45.000
No problem.

34:45.929 --> 34:50.080
[Nothing warms mortal hearts
like the scents of mortal life.]

34:48.000 --> 34:50.179
Granny, dinner's ready!

34:53.080 --> 34:54.080
Dinner time!

34:55.929 --> 34:58.990
Granny, dinner's ready! Come eat!

35:10.320 --> 35:11.700
The Leader hires you,

35:11.720 --> 35:13.230
but you don't have to be this excited.

35:13.230 --> 35:14.190
What are you talking about?

35:14.190 --> 35:15.710
I'm not excited.

35:15.790 --> 35:17.040
This is my first class.

35:17.040 --> 35:19.040
I have to prepare thoroughly.

35:19.480 --> 35:22.440
The first class is just about
putting in an appearance.

35:22.440 --> 35:23.540
Why so serious?

35:23.640 --> 35:26.210
Your mindset is really

35:26.360 --> 35:27.760
not right, you know.

35:27.790 --> 35:29.120
What do you mean,
'just putting in an appearance'?

35:29.120 --> 35:31.070
You have to be serious.

35:31.190 --> 35:32.600
Your thinking is just bad,

35:32.600 --> 35:34.080
you have a bad attitude.

35:34.520 --> 35:35.600
Old bones like mine

35:35.640 --> 35:37.440
can't dance like the young people,

35:37.440 --> 35:39.590
but in terms of choreography,

35:39.750 --> 35:41.550
I have to beat them.

35:41.830 --> 35:43.710
I absolutely cannot embarrass myself.

35:43.710 --> 35:45.610
This is for Dang Yu, isn't it?

35:48.080 --> 35:49.960
If she wants to be with my son,

35:50.040 --> 35:52.390
she has to get past me first.

36:09.750 --> 36:10.520
Hey,

36:12.670 --> 36:14.720
do you guys know a crosstalk actor

36:14.750 --> 36:16.320
called Osamu?

36:16.480 --> 36:17.480
What?

36:17.640 --> 36:18.940
Osamu!

36:19.400 --> 36:20.350
I don't know.

36:20.480 --> 36:21.640
Never heard of him.

36:22.120 --> 36:24.680
Look at you all, so out of the loop!

36:24.710 --> 36:26.000
You don't know Osamu?

36:26.030 --> 36:28.400
He's the hottest crosstalk star right now!

36:28.400 --> 36:29.260
Is he your idol?

36:29.630 --> 36:30.060
I...

36:31.920 --> 36:33.110
Not my idol.

36:33.230 --> 36:34.790
My friend's idol.

36:34.830 --> 36:36.800
He has a solo show this weekend,

36:36.960 --> 36:38.350
and tickets are sold out.

36:38.350 --> 36:40.510
Can you get me two VIP tickets?

36:42.040 --> 36:42.970
I don't have those connections.

36:42.970 --> 36:43.880
Ask Ziyo.

36:44.270 --> 36:45.600
No, no, don't ask me.

36:45.670 --> 36:46.530
Can't get them.

36:49.350 --> 36:50.150
Hey, guys!

36:50.150 --> 36:52.350
-Hi, Yifei.
-Jinzi. Come, sit here!

36:53.780 --> 36:55.320
You invited her?

36:55.710 --> 36:56.970
What did she give you?

36:56.990 --> 36:58.480
You stay with her every day.

36:58.480 --> 36:59.330
She's eager to see you.

36:59.330 --> 37:00.930
What's that got to do with me?

37:04.120 --> 37:04.830
Listen to me.

37:04.830 --> 37:06.520
Jinzi is very popular recently.

37:06.520 --> 37:07.710
The platform has signed her.

37:07.710 --> 37:09.710
She's on her way
to becoming a top influencer.

37:09.710 --> 37:11.520
In the future, if any of us have business

37:11.520 --> 37:12.230
with a short video platform,

37:12.230 --> 37:13.630
we'll bring Jinzi along.

37:14.080 --> 37:14.600
Cheers.

37:16.000 --> 37:17.310
You know people
from short-video platforms?

37:17.310 --> 37:18.620
Of course I know.

37:26.960 --> 37:28.590
Excuse me, are you Miss Yu?

37:28.620 --> 37:29.820
This is your milk tea.

37:29.830 --> 37:31.160
I didn't order milk tea.

37:31.270 --> 37:32.980
This is a gift from a gentleman.

37:32.980 --> 37:34.910
He also said that milk tea is sweet,

37:34.920 --> 37:35.870
but not as sweet as you.

37:35.870 --> 37:36.870
Please accept it.

37:37.270 --> 37:38.280
Thank you.

37:38.480 --> 37:39.080
Wait.

37:39.270 --> 37:40.600
That gentleman also specially requested

37:40.600 --> 37:41.460
a dance for you.

37:41.520 --> 37:42.520
Please enjoy it.

37:59.230 --> 37:59.920
Good night.

38:12.480 --> 38:14.860
I'll give you a five-star review.

38:18.000 --> 38:19.710
Next time,
don't make the delivery guy dance.

38:19.710 --> 38:22.170
If you want a dance,
dance it for me yourself.

38:24.070 --> 38:26.030
No problem. Anytime.

38:26.760 --> 38:28.170
[Dang Yu]

38:36.310 --> 38:37.560
I'm telling you, this Osamu,

38:37.560 --> 38:38.860
he's so inspiring!

38:39.190 --> 38:40.140
You know what?

38:40.230 --> 38:42.190
He had a car accident a few years ago.

38:42.190 --> 38:44.400
He had dozens of steel pins
put in his body,

38:44.400 --> 38:45.440
and almost died.

38:45.640 --> 38:46.870
And guess what?

38:46.870 --> 38:48.040
He turned it into a joke

38:48.040 --> 38:49.190
and told it to everyone.

38:49.190 --> 38:50.970
He is really amazing, isn't he?

38:51.190 --> 38:52.050
Where's Jinzi?

38:52.350 --> 38:53.290
Jinzi?

38:53.400 --> 38:54.870
Jinzi left a while ago.

38:54.920 --> 38:55.710
Later, he...

38:55.750 --> 38:57.040
Stop talking about Osamu.

38:57.040 --> 38:58.000
You've been rambling
about him for thirty minutes.

38:58.000 --> 38:59.510
You bored her away.

38:59.640 --> 39:01.210
She must be upset.

39:01.270 --> 39:03.040
I'd feel wronged too.

39:03.150 --> 39:05.120
You completely ignored her.

39:05.310 --> 39:06.830
You're really something.

39:06.960 --> 39:09.310
We can hang out
next time she's in a good mood.

39:09.310 --> 39:10.440
What's the matter?

39:10.440 --> 39:12.970
Man, would it kill you
to comfort her a little?

39:13.150 --> 39:13.560
I...

39:15.350 --> 39:17.570
Am I the kind of guy who comforts women?

39:17.750 --> 39:18.230
Fine.

39:18.710 --> 39:21.040
There you go, playing the tough guy again.

39:21.190 --> 39:22.660
Whatever, let her go.

39:22.790 --> 39:24.310
Let's drink. Come on.

39:24.310 --> 39:24.790
Come on.

39:25.230 --> 39:25.750
Cheers.

39:27.480 --> 39:28.960
What time is it? I have to go back.

39:28.960 --> 39:29.850
One last sip.

39:30.400 --> 39:31.620
What's going on?

39:31.710 --> 39:33.000
You've gone straight all of a sudden?

39:33.000 --> 39:34.120
It's barely past ten.

39:34.120 --> 39:35.640
The night is just getting started.

39:35.640 --> 39:37.810
I have the early shift tomorrow. Do you?

39:37.810 --> 39:38.920
I'll call you in the morning.

39:38.920 --> 39:40.150
No, no, don't call me, man.

39:40.150 --> 39:41.040
I'm leaving.

39:41.920 --> 39:42.540
Wait.

39:42.640 --> 39:44.620
Tell me when you get the tickets.

39:44.830 --> 39:46.190
No regular tickets. VIP tickets.

39:46.190 --> 39:47.790
No, I can't get them.

39:47.790 --> 39:49.960
You have to. He works really hard.

39:50.920 --> 39:52.480
Just go already.

39:52.920 --> 39:54.320
This is driving me crazy.

39:54.920 --> 39:55.850
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

39:57.440 --> 39:58.190
That's all.

40:00.530 --> 40:01.360
Director Li.

40:02.120 --> 40:04.590
There's a beautiful woman
looking for you in the lobby.

40:04.590 --> 40:05.970
Looking for me?

40:06.270 --> 40:08.340
She's so pretty, like a star.

40:08.680 --> 40:10.610
Go now. She's been waiting for you.

40:18.120 --> 40:19.750
Xi, is she really that pretty?

40:19.750 --> 40:20.750
Like a star?

40:20.920 --> 40:22.400
-Yeah, pretty.
-Really like a star, Xi?

40:22.400 --> 40:23.410
Tall and slim,

40:23.430 --> 40:24.890
with really slender legs.

40:25.270 --> 40:27.230
Way prettier than those

40:27.230 --> 40:28.230
live-streaming influencers.

40:28.230 --> 40:29.640
Is she his girlfriend?

40:29.750 --> 40:31.610
I didn't hear he has a girlfriend.

40:32.000 --> 40:32.730
I don't know.

40:34.010 --> 40:35.800
Xi, is she prettier than you?

40:35.830 --> 40:37.830
She's much prettier than me.

40:38.350 --> 40:41.710
Stop saying I'm dramatic,
you're full of drama yourself.

40:53.470 --> 40:54.080
Jinzi.

40:54.790 --> 40:55.560
Yifei.

40:55.920 --> 40:57.190
What's the matter?

41:01.480 --> 41:02.700
[Osamu's Crosstalk:
The Cure for Unhappiness]

41:05.350 --> 41:06.850
How did you get the tickets

41:07.120 --> 41:08.650
to Osamu's crosstalk show?

41:08.800 --> 41:10.190
These tickets are so hard to get.

41:10.190 --> 41:11.650
Osamu is very popular now.

41:11.670 --> 41:13.250
I had to pull a lot of strings

41:12.080 --> 41:14.440
[Osamu's Crosstalk:
The Cure for Unhappiness]

41:13.270 --> 41:14.580
to get them for you.

41:15.870 --> 41:17.190
Great, thanks so much.

41:17.830 --> 41:20.160
Be specific.
How are you going to thank me?

41:20.830 --> 41:22.870
Tell me, how do you want me to thank you?

41:22.870 --> 41:23.930
Anything you want,

41:24.000 --> 41:24.840
I'll do it.

41:25.430 --> 41:26.290
That generous?

41:27.970 --> 41:30.020
I have to think about it.

41:30.960 --> 41:31.440
OK.

41:36.400 --> 41:37.600
You can owe me for now.

41:38.770 --> 41:40.570
Don't. I hate owing favors.

41:40.600 --> 41:43.080
You guys in finance are actually
afraid of going into debt?

41:43.080 --> 41:45.440
Don't worry.
I won't make things difficult for you.

41:45.440 --> 41:46.410
I'm leaving.

41:47.640 --> 41:48.640
Wait, wait, wait.

41:50.150 --> 41:52.680
How much were the tickets?
I'll transfer you.

41:52.960 --> 41:53.920
Next time.

41:59.310 --> 42:00.120
Thank you.

42:18.000 --> 42:19.150
My landlady.

42:20.920 --> 42:21.910
My landlady.

42:23.150 --> 42:25.470
What are we having for dinner tonight?

42:26.920 --> 42:29.420
Aren't you trying to get in shape?

42:29.520 --> 42:31.520
Ever heard of not eating after noon?

42:31.710 --> 42:34.800
It'll help you get those abs.

42:35.230 --> 42:35.870
Really?

42:37.200 --> 42:39.090
I suggest, before you go on strike,

42:39.090 --> 42:40.340
you take a look at this

42:40.560 --> 42:41.660
and then decide.

42:42.400 --> 42:43.790
Comrade Li Fei.

42:46.730 --> 42:48.400
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:49.350 --> 42:50.360
What are you doing?

42:50.360 --> 42:51.350
I've already made plans with someone.

42:51.350 --> 42:52.170
Give me tickets...

42:52.170 --> 42:53.130
Why?

42:53.640 --> 42:54.500
Give them to me.

42:55.040 --> 42:55.600
No.

42:55.640 --> 42:56.230
Give them to me.

42:56.230 --> 42:57.560
I love him.

42:58.400 --> 42:59.750
Someone told me

43:00.350 --> 43:01.950
as long as I get the ticket,

43:02.270 --> 43:03.710
she'd take my last name.

43:03.740 --> 43:04.670
Am I right?

43:05.790 --> 43:06.950
I'll give you a choice:

43:06.950 --> 43:07.940
Tan.

43:08.600 --> 43:09.520
Tan Fei.

43:09.700 --> 43:10.630
Hey, Jinzi.

43:14.940 --> 43:17.130
So many romantic prospects.
